 "markdown": "> MOCK — scripted, no AI model. Numbers come from real tool calls on the local cache.\n\n## Answer\nSchedule maintenance in the lowest-usage windows observed in the Bolzano area: Thu 05:00-07:00 (6.6% occupancy), Tue 05:00-07:00 (12.4% occupancy), Fri 05:00-07:00 (14.6% occupancy) [E2]. Avoid the busiest windows.\n\n## Key findings\n- Thu 05:00-07:00: occupancy 6.6% across 5 comparable dates [E2].\n- Tue 05:00-07:00: occupancy 12.4% across 4 comparable dates [E2].\n- Fri 05:00-07:00: occupancy 14.6% across 4 comparable dates [E2].\n- Busiest: Wed 20:00-22:00 at 72.0% occupancy [E2].\n- Busiest: Sat 21:00-23:00 at 65.4% occupancy [E2].\n- Overall Bolzano occupancy in the window: 43.5% [E2].\n\n## Recommendation\nBook maintenance in the first window listed above, use the next two as fallbacks, and notify users in advance. Re-check the profile before each booking.\n\n## Limitations & unknowns\n- Status observations measure occupancy only, not energy, sessions or unmet demand [E1].\n- Analysis window 2026-09-19..2026-11-14 (56 days); hours with gaps over 120 minutes are excluded, so coverage is partial [E1].\n- Bolzano is a bounding box, not the municipal boundary. No forecasts are used.\n\n## Sources\n- [E1] dataset_overview() — Open Data Hub South Tyrol e-mobility, window 2026-09-19..2026-11-14\n- [E2] hourly_profile(scope=bolzano) — Open Data Hub South Tyrol e-mobility, window 2026-09-19..2026-11-14\n- [E3] rank_sites(metric=occupancy, area=bolzano, top_n=3, order=desc) — Open Data Hub South Tyrol e-mobility, window 2026-09-19..2026-11-14\n- [E4] hourly_profile(scope=Neogy-AMPECO:78226) — Open Data Hub South Tyrol e-mobility, window 2026-09-19..2026-11-14\n",
